J.-Q. Z. acknowledges the Kennedy Trust Prize Studentship (AZT00050-AZ04) and the Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences (CAMS) Innovation Fund for Medical Science (CIFMS), China (grant number: 2024-I2M-2-001-1).</p>
